        "created_at": "2024-07-02T23:19:32.419Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If no one else is going to post about it, I guess I will - Kickstarter backers can get a pdf of this year’s GenCon one-shot adventure over on the updates page.  Includes a new heroic power source called Shardborn, stats for Citizen Dawn and a bunch of her followers.  Non-backers will probably be able to get it (and physical copies while they last) when at the beginning of August when GenCon starts.</p>",
