        "created_at": "2025-05-19T00:53:43.356Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the heads-up! Just grabbed the PDF and I’m really curious about this Shardborn power source. Always cool to see Citizen Dawn getting more spotlight too. Can’t wait to try it out with my group!</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
